Unload graphics without deleting the saved level's logical entities and lights.

GameData.changeLevel installs the destination LightManager before the loading
screen cleans up the old level.  Calling entity deletion during this cleanup
removes the destination's same-UID lights after Continue, and removes dormant
levels' persistent emitters/lights when revisiting them.  Give graphics unloading
its own lifetime operation; ordinary gameplay deletion retains dispose().

